OL,3,GNEWSA'How I became a three-time fitness
OL,4,Aworld champion at 16'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July, 16-year-old Keira McManus
OL,7,Fbecame the first female athlete in
OL,8,FCrossFit history to win three teenage
OL,9,Fworld championships.
OL,11,FShe beat 19 other competitors in the
OL,12,Fage 16-17 category at the 2026 CrossFit
OL,13,FGames in California - her third victory
OL,14,Fin a row after winning the age 14-15
OL,15,Ftitle twice.
OL,17,F"I'm quite proud of myself because of
OL,18,Fall the training that went into it, and
OL,19,FI've had such a busy year of
OL,20,Fcompeting," said the Stoke-on-Trent
OL,21,Fteenager.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
